  "question": {
    "text": "In a transformer the number of primary turns is four times that of the secondary turns. Its primary is connected to an AC&nbsp; source of voltage <math><mi>V</mi><mo>.</mo></math> Then",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "I8Cj0",
      "text": "current through its secondary is about four times that of the current through its primary.",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "Udo7j",
      "text": "voltage across its secondary is about four times that of the voltage across its primary.",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "a2z8v",
      "text": "voltage across its secondary is about two times that of the voltage across the primary.",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "YTlqu",
      "text": "voltage across its secondary is about <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math> times of the voltage across its primary.",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "In a transformer the primary and secondary currents are related by<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><br />And the voltage are related by<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><br />Where subscripts p and s refer to the primary and secondary of the transformer.<br /><br />Here, <math><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><msub><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msub><mrow><mi>I</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></math><br /><br />And <math><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
    "image": null
  },
